11
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
Official Secrets is a 2019 British drama film directed by Gavin Hood, based on the case of whistleblower Katharine Gun, who exposed an illegal spying operation by American and
British intelligence services to gauge sentiment of and potentially blackmail United Nations diplomats tasked to vote on a resolution regarding the 2003 invasion of Iraq.

12
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
Keira Knightley stars as Gun, alongside Matt Smith, Matthew
Goode, Adam Bakri, Indira Varma and Ralph Fiennes.

13
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
The film had its world premiere at the Sundance Film Festival on 28 January 2019 and was released in the United States
on 30 August 2019, by IFC Films, and in the United Kingdom on 18 October 2019, by Entertainment One.

14
01:38:00,000 --> 01:38:06,000
The film explores themes of london, england, washington dc,
usa, politics, biography, based on true story.

15
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:06,000
The tone is emotional and intense.
